        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#d37295'>Orders Data</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>To track the impact of boosting, we look at the total_orders and change in boosting. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Boosting is remaining for only 10 vendors, and the rest of them was removed on CW 38</run>
          </formatted-text>
